.TH GLISSANDO-SETTINGS 1 "" "glissando" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
glissando\-settings \- settings of the glissando on-screen keyboard
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B glissando\-settings
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B glissando\-settings
is a graphical application that changes the layouts, appearance, gestures,
corrections and clipboard history of \fBglissando\fR(1), manages the personal
dictionary and deletes learned data. A running keyboard applies changes
at once.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/glissando/config.toml
Configuration file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR glissando (1)
